WEBVTT

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.310
I'll bury all three of you this turn!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.670
Go, Nitro Warrior!

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.190
Dynamite Knuckle!

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:29.810
Why?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.400
Three people in one turn?

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.930
One turn, three kill!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:44.760
He's incredible!

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.860
You might be able to defeat Kiryu!

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:51.320
But I'm rare.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:54.360
My fee will be expensive.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:57.520
I'll give you as much money as you want!

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:02.010
With your skills, you'll 
defeat Kiryu in an instant!

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:24.290
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:29.830
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:34.410
Don't look back and keep going

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:40.070
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:45.110
There's no need to fear

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:52.750
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:58.890
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:04.530
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:10.120
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:18.040
And will lead you to a bright place

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:50.040
Rescue Kiryu!The Town of Wandering Duelists

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:57.150
Cheers!

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:04.560
If you keep winning, Malcolm 
will run out of pieces.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.790
Then Ramon Group will control that mountain!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:08.860
Thank you.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.550
There's always a chance 
that I'll lose tomorrow.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:19.170
He could be more friendly.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.780
There's no way that he'll lose.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:25.550
He discards his hand and destroys 
the enemy with no cards.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.750
It's a scary technique.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.650
That's his only good quality.

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.330
I sacrifice their souls.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:47.190
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:22.640
Why did I remember that?

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:24.670
I want to erase my guilt.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.140
Kiryu!

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:32.430
Why is Yusei here?

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:35.080
Actually, this was expected.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.850
You again.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.160
That was incredible, Kiryu.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.460
No wonder you're Team Satisfaction's leader!

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.560
Stop it.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:57.030
I'm going to become a powerful duelist like 
you and rescue my father from the mountain.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:58.400
Just give up.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.500
Those who went to the mountain 
will never come back.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.160
That's not true!

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.070
If I become strong like you-

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.880
Dueling doesn't help.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:14.350
You and your sister need to leave this 
town before dueling possesses you.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.140
Bro...

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:46.200
This town is only alive during sunset.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.610
At other times, it's dead.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:08.010
What was he feeling when 
he threw this pendant?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:15.340
You don't need funeral flowers anymore.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:57.240
Malcolm, the muscleman you 
gave me yesterday was useless.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.310
He already passed out.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:03.080
I hope you have someone energetic today 
to make sure that doesn't happen.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:08.650
You won't brag for much longer!

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:12.160
I'm sending your grim reaper 
to that hellish mountain today!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.680
Our master won't lose!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.540
Master, end this quickly as usual.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.740
Bring out the guy you're 
sending to the mountain!

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.650
You punk!

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.340
Master, we're counting on you.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:37.650
Kiryu.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.430
I knew you'd be my opponent.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.000
I'm here to take you home.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.390
Let's go home together, Kiryu.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.080
I can't go home with you.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.130
One of us is going to the mountain.

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.370
I won't let that happen!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.910
You're the guy who tried to 
talk to our master yesterday.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.140
You knew each other?

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.880
Do you think I'm going to lose on purpose?

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:03.950
Of course not.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:07.850
Because if you lose, you'll be 
sent to the hellish mountain.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.320
You really want to battle?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:11.120
Yeah.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.590
Fine.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.810
Kiryu, you can do it!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.710
Duel!

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.750
You were quicker.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:46.850
It seems so.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.190
Who was faster?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.230
It looked like a tie to me.

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.590
My turn.  I draw.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.370
I summon Infernity Randomizer.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:04.140
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:07.660
He summoned a monster in attack 
position on the first turn.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.610
And it only has 900 attack points.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.600
Is he trying to trap me with his set card?

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.070
Even if that's the case, I'm going for it!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.580
I'll step right in so that 
I can hear his thoughts!

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.550
My turn!

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.460
I summon Speed Warrior!

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:32.360
When it's successfully summoned, Speed 
Warrior's effect doubles its attack points

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.570
during this turn's Battle Phase!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:39.540
Next, I equip Speed Warrior with 
the Equip Spell Fighting Spirit!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:47.510
Speed Warrior gains 300 attack 
points for each of your monsters.

00:09:47.510 --> 00:09:51.130
Speed Warrior's total attack points are 2100!

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:59.260
Speed Warrior attacks Infernity Randomizer!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:00.950
Sonic Edge!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:08.200
I flip over my trap card Infernity Reflector!

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:20.780
When an Infernity monster is destroyed,

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:24.720
I can send all the cards in my hand to 
the graveyard to negate its destruction.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:29.150
And you take 1000 points of damage.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.590
His handless combo.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:41.260
There it is.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:43.230
Kiryu...

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:50.270
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.860
My turn.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.350
I set one card.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.230
I activate Infernity Randomizer's effect!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:29.040
Once per turn, I draw a card 
and send it to the graveyard.

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:35.610
If that card is a monster card, you take 
damage equal to its Level multiplied by 200 points.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:40.960
But if it's any other card type, 
I take 500 points of damage.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:43.840
You're going to rely on luck?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.430
That's not like you, Kiryu!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.040
Don't lose your temper.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.900
It's only a duel.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.170
I just need to win.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:56.800
That's right.  There's no way 
our master would make a mistake.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.620
Is our master really okay?

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:00.370
Probably.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.100
It's Level 6.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.400
Level 6?  He's cheating!

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.360
Be quiet.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.600
What?

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:31.400
Damn...

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:40.950
I end my turn.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.510
What am I doing?

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:47.690
At this rate, I can't rescue Kiryu!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.460
You don't need funeral flowers anymore.

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:07.280
In order to rescue Kiryu, 
you have to defeat him.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:11.290
When he loses and is free of Ramon's 
control, that's our chance.

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:16.580
We'll grab him before those 
men take him to the mountain.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:25.680
But first, I have to defeat Kiryu.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:26.840
My turn!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.660
I summon Max Warrior!

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.940
What happened to you, Kiryu?

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.470
That monster is in the way.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:50.940
In order for my wishes to reach Kiryu's 
heart, I have to battle him head-on.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:54.240
That will lead me to defeating Kiryu!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:57.190
Max Warrior attacks Infernity Randomizer!

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:02.660
Due to Max Warrior's effect, it gains 400 
attack points during the Damage Step!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.600
Swift Rush!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:11.350
I wish we could've played around more.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:13.980
Kiryu...

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:17.480
I activate the trap card Damage Gate.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:22.280
I Special Summon a monster 
from my graveyard that has

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.510
equal or less attack points 
than the damage I took.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:27.650
I summon Infernity Beetle.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.720
Speed Warrior attacks Infernity Beetle!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.300
They both have 1200 attack points.

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:35.820
He's aiming for mutual destruction.

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:37.360
Sonic Edge!

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:46.200
By destroying the Equip Spell Fighting 
Spirit, Speed Warrior isn't destroyed.

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.050
I end my turn!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.470
You never change.

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:55.160
You don't just try to win.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:59.780
You're trying to draw out 
my heart through dueling.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.650
In that case...

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.070
Sorry, Yusei.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.750
It's no good.  I don't care.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.220
What don't you care about?

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:12.190
I don't care if I live or die.

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:13.580
Why?

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:19.930
You always gave everything you 
had to duel honestly and head-on!

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.770
We're going to color this black!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.480
Team Satisfaction!

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.510
Let's go!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.100
Kiryu...

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:38.150
But I remembered.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:41.150
That I was a Dark Signer.

00:15:42.410 --> 00:15:46.410
That I battled against you, Yusei.

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:56.270
Due to a slight misunderstanding, 
I hated you and tried to kill you.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.540
Even though we were teammates...

00:15:58.540 --> 00:15:59.870
Even though we were friends...

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:07.350
But Kiryu, all was forgiven 
after our last duel!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.650
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:20.360
I couldn't hate you enough.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.170
How embarrassing.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:29.530
I don't feel satisfied.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:34.740
Kiryu...

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:44.350
I still carry the scars of my guilt.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.960
Kiryu!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:50.330
Lke you said, dueling was everything to me.

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:52.560
I couldn't live without dueling.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.390
But I now hate dueling.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:17:05.400
Yusei, Jack and Crow were more important 
than dueling, but I made you suffer.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.370
Kiryu, we didn't suffer!

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:15.850
Even if that's true, I can't bear it.

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:17.690
Kiryu...

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:23.150
But I still couldn't abandon dueling.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:27.960
In that case, dueling 
and I will die together.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.270
Before I knew it, I was in this town.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.730
I was waiting for someone 
who could end my life.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.970
And it turns out to be you.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:42.440
It's ironic, but it's good.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.410
I came here to rescue you!

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:48.430
You saved me many times already.

00:17:48.430 --> 00:17:50.650
Yusei, finish me with your own hands.

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:55.420
No!  I know you're still 
passionate about dueling!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.890
I'll find that light!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:01.620
Yusei, my passion is gone.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.760
I'm just a ghost that draws cards.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.530
Kiryu...

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.790
Stop talking!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.130
Hurry up and continue the duel!

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.120
My turn.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.930
I activate the spell card ZERO-MAX.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:22.080
I can activate it when it's 
the only card in my hand.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:26.510
I select one Infernity monster in 
my graveyard and Special Summon it.

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:30.880
Then all monsters who have equal or 
less attack points are destroyed.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:31.990
What?

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:35.460
Appear, Infernity Destroyer!

00:18:38.190 --> 00:18:41.860
All monsters with 2300-or-fewer 
attack points are turned to ash.

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:50.270
When ZERO-MAX activates, 
I can't battle that turn.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.500
I end my turn.

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.130
Kiryu, you are truly powerful.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.390
You haven't given up on dueling.

00:18:57.390 --> 00:19:00.250
Similarly, you haven't given up on living!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:01.640
You're wrong.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.270
Dueling possesses me.

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:06.320
Dueling won't let me go.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:09.720
It's pulling me towards a living hell.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:13.900
Then I will give you hope!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.100
My turn!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:18.940
I summon the Tuner Monster Junk Synchron!

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.840
When this monster is successfully summoned,

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:27.870
I can Special Summon a 
Level 2-or-below monster

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:30.580
from my graveyard in defense position!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:32.810
Come, Speed Warrior!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:39.550
When a Tuner Monster is on my field,

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:43.790
I can Special Summon Boost Warrior 
from my hand in defense position!

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:49.800
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Speed Warrior!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.720
The stars come together 
to call forth a new power!

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:55.200
Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:56.670
Synchro Summon!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.030
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:04.490
When Junk Warrior is Synchro Summoned,

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:07.720
it gains attack points equal 
to the total attack points

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.850
of Level 2-or-below monsters on my field!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:15.050
It gains Level 1 Boost 
Warrior's 300 attack points!

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:19.630
Then I activate Boost Warrior's effect!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:25.350
A Warrior-Type monster on my 
field gains 300 attack points!

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:30.830
Junk Warrior attacks Infernity Destroyer!

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:36.810
Kiryu!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:43.880
If my monster is destroyed in battle 
when I have no cards in my hand...

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:48.780
I can Special Summon Infernity Avenger 
from my graveyard in defense position.

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:55.820
When this effect summons Infernity Avenger, its 
Level becomes the same as the destroyed monster.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:56.760
What?

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:59.800
Infernity Destroyer's Level was 6.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:09.140
900 life points.

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:13.720
Just a little more and I'll be dead.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:19.010
Yusei, I'm satisfied because 
you're my opponent.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.190
You're wrong!

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.880
There's no way that you're satisfied!

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:25.030
It can't be helped.

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.020
I can't betray you or dueling.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:36.260
Therefore, I'll have my teammate 
and friend finish me in a duel.

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:39.160
That will have to satisfy me.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:41.290
Kiryu...

00:22:09.270 --> 00:22:14.260
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:19.140
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:24.080
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.080 --> 00:22:29.080
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:34.140
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:40.690
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:44.770
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:50.600
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:54.700
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.700 --> 00:23:00.310
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:03.500
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:05.760
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:10.290
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.290 --> 00:23:13.260
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:16.700
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:20.080
At our special place
